flowchart LR
    U[学生 / 演示用户] --> UI[Streamlit 页面]
    UI -->|AgentClient HTTP| API[FastAPI 服务]
    API --> ENG[LangGraph 工程版 Agent]
    CLI[Python 原理版 CLI] --> PR[NumPy RAG + 显式 ToolRegistry]

    ENG --> LLM[DeepSeek Flash API]
    PR --> LLM
    ENG --> RET[Chroma 检索]
    PR --> RET2[NumPy cosine 检索]
    RET --> EMB[本机 Ollama BGE-M3]
    RET2 --> EMB
    RET --> SRC[14 份带范围元数据的校园快照]
    RET2 --> SRC
    ENG --> DB[(SQLite 合成状态 / 工单)]
    PR --> DB
    ENG --> CP[(SQLite checkpoint)]
    PR --> MEM[(SQLite 有界会话记忆)]
    ENG --> RUNS[运行 Manifest / Trace]
    PR --> RUNS
    EVAL[冻结集与四层指标] --> RUNS

